  "summary": "出租车从一开到 n，可接起终点递增的乘客且行程不能重叠，收益为距离加小费，求最大总收益。",
  "insight": "按终点排序行程，令 dp[position] 为到达该位置时最大收益。每个终点继承前一位置收益，并用所有在此结束的行程从 dp[start] 转移。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "可空驶前往下一起点",
    "同一终点可能有多条行程",
    "收益使用 long"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "endpoint-dynamic-programming",
      "title": "按终点位置 DP",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "沿道路坐标依次处理所有以当前位置结束的行程。",
      "steps": [
        "rides 按 end 排序，dp[0..n]",
        "position 从 1 到 n，dp[position]=dp[position-1]",
        "处理 end==position 的 ride：dp[position]=max(dp[position],dp[start]+end-start+tip)，返回 dp[n]"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n+r log r)",
        "space": "O(n)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/endpoint-dynamic-programming/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/endpoint-dynamic-programming/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/endpoint-dynamic-programming/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
